  "description": "Beyond 2 is just like our Beyond 1 only brighter! We’ve fitted it with a Supernova lighting system running off a KT dynamo hub for a permanent lighting solution. We also fitted a front luggage rack so it’s as equally capable of collecting the pizzas on the way home, as it is at packing your sleeping kit for a sneaky night out under the stars. The Sram Apex 1 x 11 mechanical transmission keeps things simple yet capable, and reliable stopping power comes from the simple to maintain TRP Spyre C brakes. 700 x 50C Panaracer Gravel King SK tyres open up a whole world of road and trail surfaces – the sky really is the limit with the Beyond 2.\n\nWTB ST i23 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h\n\nWTB ST i23 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h\n\nWeight frame: 2540 g frame (size M, incl. TA, bolts, seatclamp, hanger)",
